<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 30.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR MAY 30.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Friday, May 30:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,568.10 (1,568.40)	CHF  1,108.20 (1,106.40)</p>
<p>    DEM    921.54 (922.59)	  GBP  2,568.90 (2,562.80)</p>
<p>    ATS    130.88 (131.09)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Thursday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $17.90 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$13.59 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $31.49 million ($32.86 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
